{
  "id": 8834787442887,
  "title": "Custom Photo Quilt with Bicycle and Flowers",
  "handle": "custom-photo-quilt-bicycle-flowers-07e2c6fca1-07e2c6fca1",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring warmth, comfort, and cherishable memories into your home with this beautiful custom photo quilt by Jeminise. Perfectly designed to showcase your favorite moments, this high-quality personalized quilt serves as a unique keepsake and a cozy addition to any bedroom, sofa, or outdoor adventure.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this quilt with up to 10 of your favorite high-resolution photos and up to 2 custom text inputs to create an unforgettable family keepsake.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Premium Materials:</strong> Crafted with a breathable, soft cotton blend outer fabric and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, year-round warmth and comfort.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Designed for consecutive warmth in all seasons, making it perfect as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket on the sofa, picnic mat, or camping companion.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from a range of sizes to suit your space, including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your custom bedding set with optional matching customized pillowcases, available in quantities of 1 or 2.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and quick-drying for effortless maintenance and long-lasting durability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Brand</th>\n      <td>Jeminise</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Product Type</th>\n      <td>Quilt</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Material</th>\n      <td>Cotton Blend</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Fabric Type</th>\n      <td>Polyester &amp; Cotton</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Fill Material</th>\n      <td>Silk Floss</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Style</th>\n      <td>Bohemian</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Pattern</th>\n      <td>Custom Photo</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Theme</th>\n      <td>Christmas</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Special Feature</th>\n      <td>Lightweight</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Seasons</th>\n      <td>All, Spring, Winter</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Care Instructions</th>\n      <td>Machine Wash</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
